---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4 bg-white">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-10 md:gap-12 lg:gap-14 xl:gap-16 max-w-6xl my-14 md:my-16 lg:my-20">
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center max-w-3xl">
                Our Process: How We Deliver Value
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-4xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto">
                From site selection to statutory approvals, our proven process ensures every industrial park is compliant, operational, and future-ready. We combine legal due diligence, stakeholder coordination, and real-time monitoring to deliver seamless execution and lasting value.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-4 md:gap-5">
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/asset-manag-process-1.webp" alt="our-process-1" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" loading="lazy" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Discovery & Strategy
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        We start by understanding your investment goals, risk tolerance, asset type preferences, and target geographies.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex flex-row-reverse items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/asset-manag-process-2.webp" alt="our-process-2" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" loading="lazy" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full rotate-180" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Planning & Structuring
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                         We conduct rigorous due diligence, structure the investment vehicle, set budget & timeline.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/asset-manag-process-3.webp" alt="our-process-3" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" loading="lazy" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Execution & Operations
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        From constructing warehouses or retrofitting existing ones to managing tenants → everything happens under tight process control.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex flex-row-reverse items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/asset-manag-process-4.webp" alt="our-process-4" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" loading="lazy" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full rotate-180" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Monitoring & Optimization
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        Continuous tracking of performance metrics; using analytics to make course corrections for cost savings, operational efficiency, or tenant satisfaction.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/asset-manag-process-5.webp" alt="our-process-5" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" loading="lazy" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Realization & Exit
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        We plan exit strategies from the onset, whether via lease sales, portfolio divestment, or ownership transfer, ensuring maximum return and minimal risk.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>